Psa 105:1 , An exhortation to praise God, and to seek out his works;
Psa 105:7 , The story of God's providence over Abraham;
Psa 105:16 , over Joseph;
Psa 105:23 , over Jacob in Egypt;
Psa 105:26 , over Moses delivering the Israelites;
Psa 105:37 , over the Israelites brought out of Egypt, fed in the wilderness, and planted in Canaan.
